---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';

const timeline = [
	{
		date: 'Sep 2024',
		title: 'Suzhou University of Science and Technology',
		description: 'Started graduate study with a focus on applying reinforcement learning to HVAC control in building intelligence.',
	},
	{
		date: 'Sep 2019',
		title: 'Nanjing Tech University',
		description: 'Started undergraduate study at Nanjing Tech University, entered Computer Science and Technology major.',
	},
];
---

<Layout
	title="About me"
	description="A short introduction to Landfallbox, education timeline, current work, site purpose, short-term plans, and hobbies."
	showDate={false}
	showHeroImage={false}
>
	<style>
		.timeline {
			position: relative;
			display: grid;
			gap: 0;
			margin: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
			padding: 0.5rem 0;
			list-style: none;
		}

		.timeline::before {
			position: absolute;
			top: 1rem;
			bottom: 1rem;
			left: calc(7.5rem + 0.9rem + 0.75rem);
			width: 3px;
			border-radius: 999px;
			background: linear-gradient(
				to bottom,
				color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 30%, transparent),
				color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 85%, transparent),
				color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 30%, transparent)
			);
			box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, transparent);
			content: '';
			transform: translateX(-50%);
		}

		.timeline__item {
			position: relative;
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 7.5rem 1.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
			gap: 0.9rem;
			padding: 0.35rem 0 1.35rem;
		}

		.timeline__item:last-child {
			padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
		}

		.timeline__date {
			display: block;
			padding-top: 0.85rem;
			color: var(--heading);
			font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 3vw, 1.35rem);
			font-weight: 800;
			letter-spacing: -0.02em;
			line-height: 1;
			text-align: right;
		}

		.timeline__marker {
			position: relative;
			z-index: 1;
			display: flex;
			justify-content: center;
			padding-top: 0.9rem;
		}

		.timeline__marker::before {
			width: 0.85rem;
			height: 0.85rem;
			border: 3px solid var(--background);
			border-radius: 999px;
			background: var(--accent);
			box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 16%, transparent);
			content: '';
		}

		.timeline__card {
			position: relative;
			padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
			border: 1px solid var(--border);
			border-radius: 18px;
			background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface), var(--background-soft));
			box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
		}

		.timeline__card::before {
			position: absolute;
			top: 1.05rem;
			left: -0.5rem;
			width: 0.85rem;
			height: 0.85rem;
			border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
			border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
			background: var(--surface);
			transform: rotate(45deg);
			content: '';
		}

		.timeline__card h3 {
			margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		}

		.timeline__card p {
			margin: 0;
			color: var(--muted);
			font-size: 1rem;
			line-height: 1.65;
		}

		.hobby-grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
			gap: 1rem;
			margin: 1rem 0 0;
		}

		.hobby-card {
			padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
			border: 1px solid var(--border);
			border-radius: 18px;
			background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface), var(--background-soft));
			box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
		}

		.hobby-card h3 {
			margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
			font-size: 1.15rem;
			letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		}

		.hobby-card p {
			margin: 0;
			color: var(--muted);
			font-size: 1rem;
			line-height: 1.65;
		}

		.hobby-quote {
			margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
			padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
			border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
			border-radius: 14px;
			background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 7%, transparent);
		}

		.hobby-quote p {
			color: var(--heading);
			font-style: italic;
		}

		.hobby-quote footer {
			margin-top: 0.5rem;
			color: var(--muted);
			font-size: 0.92rem;
		}

		@media (max-width: 520px) {
			.timeline::before {
				left: calc(4.75rem + 0.65rem + 0.6rem);
			}

			.timeline__item {
				grid-template-columns: 4.75rem 1.2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
				gap: 0.65rem;
			}

			.timeline__date {
				font-size: 1.15rem;
			}

			.timeline__card {
				padding: 1rem;
			}

			.hobby-grid {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}
		}

		@media (max-width: 390px) {
			.timeline {
				padding-left: 0;
			}

			.timeline::before {
				left: 0.6rem;
			}

			.timeline__item {
				grid-template-columns: 1.2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
				gap: 0.7rem;
			}

			.timeline__date {
				grid-column: 2;
				padding-top: 0;
				text-align: left;
			}

			.timeline__marker {
				grid-column: 1;
				grid-row: 1 / span 2;
				padding-top: 0.25rem;
			}

			.timeline__card {
				grid-column: 2;
			}

			.timeline__card::before {
				display: none;
			}
		}
	</style>

	<ol class="timeline">
			{
				timeline.map((item) => (
					<li class="timeline__item">
						<span class="timeline__date">{item.date}</span>
						<span class="timeline__marker" aria-hidden="true" />
						<div class="timeline__card">
							<h3>{item.title}</h3>
							<p>{item.description}</p>
						</div>
					</li>
				))
			}
	</ol>

	<section aria-labelledby="now-title">
		<h2 id="now-title">What I’m working on</h2>
		<p>
			Right now, most of my time goes into graduate study. I am close to finishing my first paper, which is
			required for graduation. My research focuses on reinforcement learning for HVAC control in building
			intelligence (boring but easy to publish). Outside research, I also spend a lot of time following the 
			latest developments in LLMs (very exciting).
		</p>
	</section>

	<section aria-labelledby="blog-purpose-title">
		<h2 id="blog-purpose-title">Why I built this site</h2>
		<p>
			I built this site to record my learning process in a place that is easier to revisit than scattered
			files or temporary notes. Writing things down helps me review them later, and publishing them may
			also make the notes useful to someone who is learning the same topic.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section aria-labelledby="next-title">
		<h2 id="next-title">What’s next</h2>
		<p>
			My short-term plan is to work in industry after graduation. If possible, I hope to take part in a
			summer or day-to-day internship before then, so I can gain practical experience and prepare more
			steadily for full-time work.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section aria-labelledby="hobbies-title">
		<h2 id="hobbies-title">Life outside work</h2>
		<p>I also like to keep a few hobbies outside study and work.</p>
		<div class="hobby-grid">
			<article class="hobby-card">
				<h3>Cycling</h3>
				<p>
					I ride an XDS AD300. Cycling is my way to clear my head, stretch after long hours at the desk,
					and keep a simple routine outside of research.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="hobby-card">
				<h3>Formula 1</h3>
				<p>
					I do not have a fixed favorite team, but Sebastian Vettel once said: "Everyone is a Ferrari fan. 
					Even if they say they are not, they are Ferrari fans." So, kind of a Tifosi, I guess.
				</p>
				<p>
					Thanks to HNPF, I can follow races more easily.
				</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>

	
</Layout>
